      "title": "Theorem 1.2 of arXiv:2304.05771: Fluctuation bounds for symmetric random walks on dynamic environments via Russo-Seymour-We",
      "body": "[Theorem 1.2 of arXiv:2304.05771, 'Fluctuation bounds for symmetric random walks on dynamic environments via Russo-Seymour-We'] is then concluded in Section 5. Finally, we verify that the environments given by the Gaussian field and the Confetti percolation satisfy the hypotheses of Theorem 1.2 in Section 6, establishing Corollaries 1.3 and 1.4. Acknowledgements.",
